From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 03:32:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] fix: journey "Test as" is Halima from the shared mock
 data, not Amina

With ?journey=demo the control bar showed Amina selected and the Yoma
profile panel said "Sample profile for Amina" while Halima's journey ran.

- A Halima persona (hidden outside the journey), filled by loadJourney()
  from the shared mock data: Halima Yusuf, 20, Kaduna, phone repair, and
  the credentials she holds when the plan is made (issued before the
  Learning Plan, not self-declared).
- In the journey she is selected and the profile panel says "Sample
  profile for Halima Yusuf".
- Tests: unit test for journeyPersona(); the e2e journey scenario checks
  the selected persona and the profile panel.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YcQNX4S5GbGG8rboP8226e
